<title>ITALY: SOCCER-VICENZA WIN ITALIAN CUP FINAL.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-VICENZA WIN ITALIAN CUP FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>VICENZA, Italy 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the Italian Cup</p>
<p>final second leg between Vicenza and Napoli on Thursday:</p>
<p>    Vicenza    3   Napoli    0  (after extra time)</p>
<p>Vicenza win 3-1 on aggregate.</p>
</text>
